comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T11:59:39.059Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: request-specific policy_refused and dirty-workspace searches plus complete strict all-status 3107-item corpus read (zero unreadable records and zero omissions) found no existing owner for GH-1585. Live full predecessor metadata/comments and verified histories show pm-mj42og intentionally introduced refusal auditing and pm-o5s22y shipped policy recovery evidence; preserve those closed outcomes. This report owns the undisclosed tracked-write UX gap under recovery parent pm-f05lsg. Source inspection at workflow-policy-store.ts confirms the write-before-refusal sequence. Remains open and unclaimed."
  "2026-10-25T14:04:42.917Z","harness:codex","Implementation scope: grouped with pm-gh1579. Preserve intentional tracked refusal audits and per-attempt evidence, explicitly disclose the durable append through typed SDK errors and CLI/MCP recovery, and test repeated refusals and dry-run immutability. GitHub currently has no open PRs or dependency/code/secret-scanning alerts. No unrelated item is claimed."
  "2026-10-25T14:12:48.919Z","harness:codex","Independent failing-before controls reproduced missing SDK/CLI/MCP side_effects and dry-run evidence. All 23 focused controls now pass, including exact appended record hash, repeated per-attempt identity, immutable item history, and write-free deletion preview. Completion provenance includes a related bulk completedAt adapter correction. All four TypeScript projects pass; conservative SDK signature gate requires an explicit acknowledgement for additive optional receipt/context fields, recorded without changing existing semantics."
  "2026-10-25T14:36:47.124Z","harness:codex","Live observability proof on the revised build: required Sentry/telemetry gate passes, zero unresolved/critical/high Sentry issues,5.01 percent weighted finish-error rate and zero missing error-code rows. Hosted Sentry has a fresh successful pm contracts span. The fixed session window has92 remote sessions, each exactly one command_start and command_finish, zero unpaired; the real contracts probe ingested in at most1.916 seconds. Broker queue ready/unacknowledged counts are zero. Synthetic tests remain isolated and disable external error delivery."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T14:11:54.488Z","harness:codex","A refused domain mutation can still append durable audit evidence. Disclose that write only after append succeeds, return its exact record identity, and preserve per-attempt history and write-free previews."
